scx-loader (1.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package.
  * Built as a Cargo workspace using the cargo debhelper wrapper
    (see https://rust-team.pages.debian.net/book/process-workspace.html).
  * Ships scx_loader (D-Bus activated scheduler loader daemon), scxctl
    (CLI client) and scxtui (TUI client), together with the systemd,
    D-Bus and polkit integration files.
  * d/rules tries the offline system crate registry first and only
    falls back to downloading from crates.io when it cannot satisfy
    every dependency (then Built-Using is not recorded at all).

 -- LFRon <ronforever@outlook.com>  Thu, 17 Sep 2026 17:45:00 +0800
